### Phase 7 — Automated Validation
Verify all invariants before shipping:
- Zero broken `componentId`, `entryPointId`, `exitPointIds`, `edge.source`, or `edge.target` references.
- Every edge has `calls.length >= 1` with valid `sourceReference`.
- Typecheck (`tsc --noEmit`) and production static build (`vite build` or static bundle check) pass with 0 errors.

