## 6. Reference Scenarios to Model When Analyzing an Android App

When documenting a full Android project, ensure flows cover every real pattern present in the codebase:

1. **Activity + Intent / DeepLink + Compose + Clean Architecture (`Store Details`)**:
   `Activity -> NavHost -> Compose Screen -> UI Component -> ViewModel -> UseCase -> Repository (Interface) -> RepositoryImpl -> Remote/Local DataSources -> Retrofit API + Room DAO/Database -> External Backend`, with `DTO -> Entity -> DomainModel -> UiState` mappers.
2. **Legacy Fragment + LiveData + Controller + Manager + Auth SDK (`Authentication`)**:
   `LauncherActivity -> Controller -> BiometricManager + Fragment (LiveData) -> ViewModel -> UseCase -> RepositoryImpl -> DataSource -> Retrofit API + EncryptedSharedPreferences + FirebaseAuthSdk`.
3. **Interactor + Payment SDK + EventBus + WorkManager (`Checkout & Payment`)**:
   `Compose Screen -> ViewModel -> Interactor -> StripeSdk + RepositoryImpl -> PaymentApi + OrderDao`, publishing `SharedFlow` events to `OrderEventObserver` and enqueuing `WorkManager` `CoroutineWorker`.
4. **Offline-First Reactive Paging (`Home Feed`)**:
   `Compose Screen -> ViewModel -> UseCase -> RepositoryImpl (Paging 3 Pager + RemoteMediator) -> Room PagingSource DAO + Retrofit API`.
5. **Direct MVVM without Domain Layer + Reflective/Unknown Edge (`Profile & Preferences`)**:
   `Fragment -> ViewModel -> RepositoryImpl` directly (no `UseCase`), combining Retrofit + Jetpack `DataStore`, plus an `inferred`/`unknown` edge for reflective legacy Java AAR calls (`LegacyAnalyticsBridge`).
6. **Reactive Debounced Search (`Product Search`)**:
   `SearchScreen -> SearchBarComponent -> ViewModel (debounce + flatMapLatest) -> UseCase -> RepositoryImpl -> SearchApiService + SearchHistoryDao`.
7. **Non-UI Background Entry Point (`Push Notification & Order Sync`)**:
   `OrderPushService (Extends FirebaseMessagingService) -> NotificationController -> OrderSyncWorker + DeepLinkRouter (PendingIntent) + SystemNotificationManager -> OrderDetailScreen`.

